From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: 第一次CAPTURE streamon之前flush过时，照常配置输出口（本地，修0066）

0066的seek恢复（seek_resume）假定输出口已经配置过，所以CAPTURE streamon时跳过
session_set_config_params。OUTPUT streamoff的判断条件只看INPUT_STREAMING和
LOAD_RESOURCES，而第一次CAPTURE streamon之前的flush也满足这两个条件：播放器开播时
马上reset解码器（PiliPlus用的mpv就这样），v4l2_codec2的flush就可能赶在处理
SOURCE_CHANGE之前。这时seek_resume被置位，又因为状态到不了STREAMING而一直留着，
随后第一次CAPTURE streamon就跳过了从没发过的输出口属性。固件接着报
HFI_ERR_SESSION_INSUFFICIENT_RESOURCES（0x1009），会话进入错误状态，下一次QBUF失败。

第一次SOURCE_CHANGE会置FIRST_IPSC，它要到CAPTURE streamon才清掉；seek途中发生的
分辨率变化同样会置这一位，这时旧配置也不能沿用。所以有FIRST_IPSC时照常发属性。
venus的处理思路相同：INIT、CAPTURE_SETUP状态下的flush不进入SEEK。

seek_mode=0不能代替这个修复：上游路径在同样的时序下会触发固件断言。

---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c
index 15e2164d3..b638d58c3 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_vdec.c
@@ -432,8 +432,12 @@ int iris_vdec_streamon_output(struct iris_inst *inst)
 	const struct iris_hfi_session_ops *hfi_ops = inst->hfi_session_ops;
 	int ret;
 
-	/* seek_mode=1: the output port is configured and running, only the DPBs go back */
-	if (!inst->seek_resume) {
+	/*
+	 * seek_mode=1: the output port is configured and running, only the DPBs go back.
+	 * Not after a source change: a flush before the first CAPTURE streamon leaves
+	 * seek_resume set with an output port that was never configured.
+	 */
+	if (!inst->seek_resume || inst->sub_state & IRIS_INST_SUB_FIRST_IPSC) {
 		ret = hfi_ops->session_set_config_params(inst, V4L2_BUF_TYPE_VIDEO_CAPTURE_MPLANE);
 		if (ret)
 			return ret;
